Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?fix:=20TextTokenEstimator=20=E3=81=AE=E5=86=85?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E9=83=A8API=E4=BE=9D=E5=AD=98=E3=82=92=E5=85=AC=E9=96=8BAPI=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?Char.category=20=E3=81=AB=E7=BD=AE=E6=8F=9B?=
